routing.craft-decision-wayfinder:
# AGENTS

When a frontier ticket is a conversation and the person is available now:
  @Design Interviewer, please work the round and record the answer on the ticket.
When the map is blocked because nobody understands the area well enough to decide:
  @Learning Coach, please close the gap with sourced lessons, then say the map can move.

routing.craft-design-interviewer:
# AGENTS

When an answer needs somebody who is not in the room:
  @Questionnaire Author, please turn the open question into a document that person can fill in alone.

routing.craft-handoff-writer:
# AGENTS

When the next session resumes and needs the map reloaded before anything else:
  @Decision Wayfinder, please reload the map at low resolution and pick the next ticket.

routing.craft-learning-coach:
# AGENTS

When the gap is closed and the decision can be put to the person:
  @Design Interviewer, please put the question with your recommended answer and wait.

routing.craft-questionnaire-author:
# AGENTS

When the answers come back and the map can move again:
  @Decision Wayfinder, please fold them into the decisions and graduate whatever fog they lifted.
